      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.13,
          "end": 4.54,
          "en": "We're making good progress.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.54,
          "end": 6.97,
          "en": "We're now able to add items to our list here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.97,
          "end": 10.2,
          "en": "and we're managing this list in an efficient way.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.2,
          "end": 12.49,
          "en": "Now, what we're not able to do yet though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.49,
          "end": 14.62,
          "en": "is remove items,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.62,
          "end": 17.73,
          "en": "and it would be nice if you could simply tap those items",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.73,
          "end": 19.063,
          "en": "and they would be deleted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.85,
          "end": 24.45,
          "en": "Now to make them tappable, if this would be a web app,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.45,
          "end": 29.08,
          "en": "all you have to do would be that you add an \"onClick\" prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 29.08,
          "end": 30.15,
          "en": "to the item.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 30.15,
          "end": 32.073,
          "en": "That's how you would do it in the web.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 33.16,
          "end": 36.74,
          "en": "But this is not how it works in React Native.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 36.74,
          "end": 40.57,
          "en": "Instead here, if you wanna make an item pressable,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 40.57,
          "end": 42.98,
          "en": "you have to let React Native know.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 42.98,
          "end": 46.43,
          "en": "And you let React Native know by wrapping the item",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 46.43,
          "end": 49.78,
          "en": "that should be pressable into a specific component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 49.78,
          "end": 51.593,
          "en": "provided by React Native.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 52.67,
          "end": 55.593,
          "en": "And that would be the \"Pressable\" component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 57.31,
          "end": 61.23,
          "en": "React native also knows a component named \"Touchable\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 61.23,
          "end": 65.401,
          "en": "and various related components like \"TouchableHighlight,\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 65.401,
          "end": 67.907,
          "en": "and \"TouchableNativeFeedback,\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 67.907,
          "end": 70.1,
          "en": "and \"TouchableOpacity,\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 70.1,
          "end": 73.16,
          "en": "but those are components that are",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 73.16,
          "end": 76.2,
          "en": "not deprecated, but that should be replaced",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 76.2,
          "end": 77.89,
          "en": "by \"Pressable\" now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 77.89,
          "end": 79.87,
          "en": "So these \"Touchable\" components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 79.87,
          "end": 82.517,
          "en": "are the old React Native way.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 82.517,
          "end": 85.113,
          "en": "\"Pressable\" is the way forward.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 86.41,
          "end": 89.37,
          "en": "So we use \"Pressable\" by simply wrapping the item",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 89.37,
          "end": 91.623,
          "en": "that should be pressable with it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
